{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52388","headline":"回波乐 三十一 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 三十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人生一世里，能得几时活？\n回己审思量，何忍相劫夺。\n自命惜求死，煞他不记活。\n布施觅声名，不肯救饥渴。\n口道愿生天，不免地狱撮。\n礼佛至顶尽，终归被怆割。\n一往陷三涂，穷劫不得脱。\n寄语世间人，可（项校「不」）可浪夸阔。\n各愿寻其本，努力弃劫末。\n回心一念顷，万事即解脱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}